<title>LUXEMBOURG: NIINISTO EXPECTS PARLIAMENT TO VOTE FOR EMU.</title>
<headline>NIINISTO EXPECTS PARLIAMENT TO VOTE FOR EMU.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Finance Minister Sauli Niinisto said on Monday he expected parliament to decide in favour of joining Economic and Monetary Union (EMU) in 1999, when its decision is due in late 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;I do believe that it will be a positive decision,&quot; Niinisto told a press conference here.</p>
<p>&quot;So I look forward to Finland being among those first ones (in EMU),&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Niinisto was attending a meeting of EU Finance Ministers in Luxembourg.</p>
<p>-- Fredrik Dahl +32-75-46 0584</p>
